1
00:00:05,375 --> 00:00:08,166
Ba a haifi ɗaya ba:
amma ya zama mace.

2
00:00:08,191 --> 00:00:11,391
Babu makoma ta ilimin
halitta, tunani ko tattalin arziki

3
00:00:11,392 --> 00:00:14,932
Tana bayyana siffar
mata a cikin al'umma:

4
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:17,466
Duk wayewa ce ta halicce ta.

5
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,735
Wannan ko da yake
har yanzu yana nan.

6
00:00:19,802 --> 00:00:22,268
Duk da cewa daga 1949.

7
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,455
Simone de Beauvoir ne ta rubuta.

8
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,042
A cikin sauƙin wallafe-wallafen
da ake kira "jima'i na biyu".

9
00:00:27,619 --> 00:00:30,435
Masaniyar falsafa,
ƴar jariya, marubuciya,

10
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,235
Marubuciya, ƴan jarida...

11
00:00:32,279 --> 00:00:34,202
Beauvoir ta kasance duk wannan.

12
00:00:34,203 --> 00:00:37,104
A yau mun san ta ta
musamman saboda ta ci gaba

13
00:00:37,105 --> 00:00:41,187
Wasu daga cikin mahimman
ra'ayoyin mata na zamani.

14
00:00:41,202 --> 00:00:43,202
Amma wacece Beauvoir?

15
00:00:43,227 --> 00:00:44,892
Me muka sani game da rayuwarta?

16
00:00:44,894 --> 00:00:47,480
An haife ta a shekara ta 1908.

17
00:00:47,494 --> 00:00:48,494
A cikin Paris,

18
00:00:48,499 --> 00:00:51,488
A cikin iyali mai
arziki na Katolika.

19
00:00:51,489 --> 00:00:54,556
Tun tana shekara 15, ta riga ta
san cewa tana son zama marubuciya.

20
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:58,135
Kuma a lokacin ta rasa imaninta.

21
00:00:58,642 --> 00:01:02,602
Ta yi karatun falsafa a
jami'ar Sorbonne, Paris.

22
00:01:02,903 --> 00:01:05,960
Nan ta hadu da wasu
masu hankali na lokacin.

23
00:01:05,961 --> 00:01:07,880
Ciki har da Jean Paul Sartre:

24
00:01:07,881 --> 00:01:11,481
Mai tunanin da zai raka
ta har karshen rayuwarta.

25
00:01:12,128 --> 00:01:16,918
A 1949 ta buga
littafin "jima'i na biyu",

26
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:20,591
Kuma ko da yake ba ta dauki
kanta a matsayin mace ba tukunna.

27
00:01:20,592 --> 00:01:22,315
Ta zama tushen
gwagwarmayar duniya

28
00:01:22,316 --> 00:01:24,449
A wajen mata.

29
00:01:25,224 --> 00:01:29,537
Yaƙin duniya na biyu ya yi
tasiri sosai a rayuwar mai tunani.

30
00:01:29,538 --> 00:01:31,684
Beauvoir ta ajiye
matsayinta na rashin siyasa

31
00:01:31,685 --> 00:01:34,017
Kuma ta fara shiga cikin
rigingimun siyasa na lokacin.

32
00:01:34,018 --> 00:01:37,862
Kamar yadda za mu ce a yau.

33
00:01:37,876 --> 00:01:40,342
A cikin shekarun
1970, alal misali.

34
00:01:40,636 --> 00:01:43,415
Ta ƙirƙiri wani motsi na goyon
bayan yanke hukuncin zubar da ciki.

35
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:45,216
Wanda ake kira Choirs.

36
00:01:45,643 --> 00:01:48,576
Mawaƙa na nufin
Zaɓi a cikin Faransanci.

37
00:01:49,117 --> 00:01:52,129
Ta rasu a shekarar 1986;

38
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:53,018
Amma ta tafi

39
00:01:53,019 --> 00:01:56,082
A cikin litattafanta, kasidu
da abubuwan tunawa

40
00:01:56,269 --> 00:01:59,349
Tunani da ke ci gaba da samun
sakamako har zuwa lokacin da ya dace.

41
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,103
Ƙwararriyar, wararru

42
00:02:01,128 --> 00:02:03,725
Tunanin Simone de Beauvoir
shine wanzuwar rayuwa.

43
00:02:05,629 --> 00:02:07,188
Ko kuma a zahiri,

44
00:02:07,189 --> 00:02:09,001
Atheistic wanzuwa,

45
00:02:09,002 --> 00:02:11,002
Wanda ba shi da
tushe na tauhidi.

46
00:02:11,308 --> 00:02:12,641
A bisa wannan tsarin tunani.

47
00:02:12,655 --> 00:02:14,775
Ba a kaddara ba

48
00:02:14,789 --> 00:02:17,789
Ta kowace irin rukunan
falsafa ko ɗabi'a.

49
00:02:18,379 --> 00:02:21,242
Rayuwa ta duniya ba
su da ma'ana ta zahiri.

50
00:02:21,256 --> 00:02:23,761
Amma kowanne
yana iya ba da nasa.

51
00:02:23,762 --> 00:02:26,014
Bugu da ƙari, dole
ne ku ba shi ma'ana.

52
00:02:26,015 --> 00:02:28,281
Idan kana son yin
rayuwa ta gaskiya.

53
00:02:28,793 --> 00:02:31,392
Dan Adam yana da
'yanci, domin haka,

54
00:02:31,393 --> 00:02:33,974
An yanke muku hukuncin
yin zaɓi akai-akai.

55
00:02:33,975 --> 00:02:37,674
Kuma, saboda haka, kai ma ke
da alhakin yanke shawarar kan ku.

56
00:02:37,675 --> 00:02:40,154
Ka yanke shawarar wane
irin mutum kake son zama,

57
00:02:40,155 --> 00:02:42,249
Kuma wace irin
al'umma kuke son ginawa,

58
00:02:42,250 --> 00:02:44,982
Ta hanyar zaɓinku da ayyukanku.

59
00:02:45,402 --> 00:02:47,428
A daina neman uzuri a al'ada.

60
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:49,866
A ilmin halitta ko me!

61
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:52,739
Saboda haka, Simone
de Beauvoir ta sha

62
00:02:52,790 --> 00:02:54,257
daga wanzuwa.

63
00:02:54,550 --> 00:02:56,936
Anan abubuwan sun kasance sosai

64
00:02:56,937 --> 00:03:00,029
A cikin ci gaban ta ko da
yake, kuma ga wannan.

65
00:03:00,054 --> 00:03:03,575
Ta haɗu da ilimin falsafa, ko
da yake kimiyya da baiwar adabi.

66
00:03:04,295 --> 00:03:06,735
Ana iya taƙaita gudummuwarta
cikin manyan ra'ayoyi guda biyar:

67
00:03:07,716 --> 00:03:10,436
1- Domin samun 'yanci, kana
bukatar ka so shi kuma ka yi aiki da shi.

68
00:03:10,553 --> 00:03:12,985
A cewar Simone de Beauvoir
'yanci ne ko da yaushe

69
00:03:12,986 --> 00:03:14,519
Wuri da kafa:

70
00:03:14,921 --> 00:03:17,721
Yana faruwa a
cikin kowane mutum,

71
00:03:17,747 --> 00:03:20,347
Yanayi ta hanyar ba da mahallin.

72
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:22,373
Don haka mutane ba su da

73
00:03:22,387 --> 00:03:23,947
Irin wannan damar
domim haɓaka 'yancinsu

74
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:28,173
Kuma su aiwatar da
ayyukan rayuwarsu.

75
00:03:28,214 --> 00:03:30,250
Misali, bawa ba ya da

76
00:03:30,285 --> 00:03:32,085
Dama irin na mai gidan shi,

77
00:03:32,138 --> 00:03:34,805
Kuma matan ma
ba su da na namiji.

78
00:03:35,415 --> 00:03:36,482
Akan wannan,

79
00:03:36,508 --> 00:03:39,733
Dole ne dan Adam ya
gina, fadadawa da yaki

80
00:03:39,746 --> 00:03:42,147
Su da sauran 'yanci
a kowane lokaci.

81
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,559
A cikin kalmomin Beauvoir,

82
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:48,014
ƙin 'yanci shine yin
watsi da ɗan adam.

83
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:51,779
2- Dan-Adam yana da shubuha.

84
00:03:51,952 --> 00:03:54,757
Sabani yana da
mahimmanci ga ɗan adam.

85
00:03:55,205 --> 00:03:57,871
Dabba ce ba ta so ta zama dabba.

86
00:03:58,312 --> 00:04:00,748
Mutum yana rayuwa a halin yanzu,

87
00:04:00,749 --> 00:04:03,416
Kamar dai tsakanin abubuwan
da suka gabata da kuma gazawa.

88
00:04:03,822 --> 00:04:06,381
Mutum ne, amma kuma,
wani ɓangare na gamayya.

89
00:04:06,382 --> 00:04:09,048
Tunda dan Adam yana samuwa
ne ta hanyar alaka da sauran.

90
00:04:09,616 --> 00:04:13,770
Beauvoir ta furta kuma yayi
tunani game da waɗannan kwafin,

91
00:04:13,771 --> 00:04:16,920
Kuma ku nemi kawowa da tarawa

92
00:04:16,921 --> 00:04:19,534
Ra'ayoyin binary na yau da
kullun a cikin tunanin Turai.

93
00:04:19,654 --> 00:04:21,095
Rayuwa da mutuwa,

94
00:04:21,096 --> 00:04:22,804
Jiki da hankali,

95
00:04:22,817 --> 00:04:24,324
yanayi da al'adu,

96
00:04:24,376 --> 00:04:25,643
Namiji da mace.

97
00:04:26,215 --> 00:04:29,003
Beauvoir ta share hanya
domin bita da sake tunani

98
00:04:29,030 --> 00:04:31,830
Waɗannan tsarin binary.

99
00:04:33,595 --> 00:04:35,395
3 - mace ta ginu.

100
00:04:36,221 --> 00:04:39,375
Ta yi watsi da ƙoƙarin ƙaddara

101
00:04:39,376 --> 00:04:41,909
Mutum, namiji ko mace:

102
00:04:42,149 --> 00:04:44,631
Ya kasance daga ilimin
tattalin arziki, ya kasance daga

103
00:04:44,656 --> 00:04:47,545
ilimin halin dan Adam ya
kasance daga ilmin halitta.

104
00:04:47,570 --> 00:04:50,828
Rayuwa, sabili da haka ra'ayoyi,
ana ba da ma'ana ta hanyar aiki,

105
00:04:50,882 --> 00:04:53,936
Bisa ga ƙayyadaddun tsarin
mutum ko tsarin zamantakewa.

106
00:04:54,163 --> 00:04:56,096
Ma'anar ta fito
daga waje, da ciki.

107
00:04:56,533 --> 00:04:58,999
Babu wani abu na
halitta, ainihin asali.

108
00:04:59,359 --> 00:05:02,359
Babu zalunci ko gata ta halitta.

109
00:05:02,756 --> 00:05:06,756
Saboda haka, a matsayin
waɗannan tsarin iko da matsayi

110
00:05:06,781 --> 00:05:10,290
Al'adu ne, suna da canji.

111
00:05:10,291 --> 00:05:12,701
Ba a haifi baƙar fata ba
domin bayahude ba, Basque,

112
00:05:12,702 --> 00:05:14,835
Ka zo zama.

113
00:05:15,394 --> 00:05:19,589
Al'umma ne ke aiwatar da tsarin,
mahallin da kuma yanke shawara na mutum.

114
00:05:19,590 --> 00:05:21,190
Haka ya faru da matar.

115
00:05:22,376 --> 00:05:25,710
4- falsafar waninsa.

116
00:05:25,727 --> 00:05:29,174
Beauvoir yana amfani
da nau'in "sauran"

117
00:05:29,212 --> 00:05:32,545
Domin bayyana matsayin
mata a wannan duniyar ta maza.

118
00:05:33,223 --> 00:05:36,823
Kai bai isa ya haɓaka
aikin kyauta ba.

119
00:05:36,835 --> 00:05:40,702
Dan Adam yana haɓaka kanmu
ta hanyar dangantaka da wasu.

120
00:05:41,417 --> 00:05:45,950
Alakar da ke tsakanin kai da
ɗayan na iya zama nau'i biyu.

121
00:05:46,023 --> 00:05:47,857
Idan dangantakar
ta bunkasa a fili,

122
00:05:47,898 --> 00:05:50,057
Girmamawa zai
zama bidirectional,

123
00:05:50,111 --> 00:05:51,844
Kuma zai wadata duka biyun.

124
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:54,346
Idan, akasin haka,
ya fito daga ɗayan.

125
00:05:54,347 --> 00:05:58,280
Kamar na mai bawa,
ba za a girmama ba.

126
00:05:58,882 --> 00:06:02,682
A koyaushe za a siffanta
ɗayan a cikin alaƙa zuwa ɗayan,

127
00:06:02,684 --> 00:06:06,484
Kuma dayan zai san duniya
da su kansu ta wurin idon daya.

128
00:06:06,751 --> 00:06:09,698
Mai shi zai zama "wanda", batun;

129
00:06:09,699 --> 00:06:12,859
Bawan, a gefe
guda, "sauran", batun.

130
00:06:13,353 --> 00:06:15,391
A cikin kalmomin Beauvoir,

131
00:06:15,392 --> 00:06:17,112
abin da ke faruwa
da mata ke nan.

132
00:06:17,272 --> 00:06:21,304
Namiji shine batun, mata,
maimakon haka, sauran.

133
00:06:21,664 --> 00:06:25,864
Za mu iya samun misalin
hakan a labaran wasanni na yau.

134
00:06:25,910 --> 00:06:28,136
Wasannin maza wasanni ne.

135
00:06:28,137 --> 00:06:30,002
Wasannin mata a daya bangaren.

136
00:06:30,003 --> 00:06:34,128
Ƙananan rukuni,
ɗayan, wasanni na mata.

137
00:06:35,259 --> 00:06:41,249
5- Tunani Diversity:
bambance-bambance a cikin daidaito.

138
00:06:41,521 --> 00:06:43,321
Dangane da bambancin,

139
00:06:43,574 --> 00:06:46,307
Beauvoir ya yi watsi
da ra'ayoyi guda biyu:

140
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:49,627
A gefe guda kuma, mahangar
zalunci da mulkin mallaka:

141
00:06:49,813 --> 00:06:52,106
Daidaito cikin bambanci

142
00:06:52,718 --> 00:06:54,385
An ba da wani nau'i
na daidaiton ka'ida

143
00:06:54,411 --> 00:06:57,678
Ga wadanda suka bambanta,

144
00:06:57,930 --> 00:07:02,263
Amma dangane da ainihin
yanayin, an sake komawa.

145
00:07:03,047 --> 00:07:07,014
A daya bangaren kuma, mai tunani
yana da'awar juyar da maganar.

146
00:07:07,081 --> 00:07:09,948
Zama "bambancin daidaito".

147
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:12,472
Fara daga wannan tunanin,

148
00:07:12,473 --> 00:07:14,406
Magance bambance-bambance,

149
00:07:14,449 --> 00:07:20,216
Ta haɓaka layin tunani wanda zai yi
la'akari da su daidai da tushen tushe.

150
00:07:20,217 --> 00:07:22,624
A zahiri, wannan na iya
zama tushen fahimtar yanzu

151
00:07:22,625 --> 00:07:25,038
Na dangantakar
mallake daban-daban

152
00:07:25,105 --> 00:07:28,972
Da kuma gwagwarmayar
tsaka-tsaki.

153
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:32,296
Har yanzu muna amfani
da waɗannan ra'ayoyin

154
00:07:32,326 --> 00:07:35,393
Don fahimta da kuma
nazarin duniyar ta yanzu.

155
00:07:35,394 --> 00:07:37,660
Wannan shine dalilin da
ya sa Simone de Beauvoir

156
00:07:37,703 --> 00:07:40,835
Yana cikin mafi mahimmancin
masu tunani na karni na 20.

157
00:07:41,133 --> 00:07:44,866
Da kuma iyawarta na duban gaba:

158
00:07:45,641 --> 00:07:48,548
Sabbin alakoki na jiki da tasiri
waɗanda ba za mu iya ɗaukar ciki ba

159
00:07:48,549 --> 00:07:53,498
Za a haifa tsakanin jinsi.

160
00:07:53,803 --> 00:07:56,594
Bayan shekaru 70,

161
00:07:56,595 --> 00:07:58,462
Za mu iya cewa ta yi gaskiya?

162
00:07:58,999 --> 00:08:03,495
Ko har yanzu ba mu haɓaka
dangantakar da ba za mu iya tunanin ba.